WEBVTT

00:02:57.924 --> 00:03:02.595
And that’s because in Formula 1,
there are only 20 professional drivers.

00:03:02.637 --> 00:03:05.973
There are ten teams
with two drivers per team.

00:03:06.724 --> 00:03:10.228
It's perhaps the most inaccessible
sport in the world.

00:03:10.269 --> 00:03:13.356
Suffice to say, there are going to be
so many people with dreams,

00:03:13.397 --> 00:03:17.735
talent and ambition to get there
who will never be able to make it.

00:03:18.861 --> 00:03:21.530
I'm going to introduce you
to someone called Rudy.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:22.740
Rudy Van Buren.

00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:26.035
He grew up in the Netherlands,
next to a go-karting track.

00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:28.037
At the age of eight,

00:03:28.037 --> 00:03:31.082
he got given a birthday
present, a go-cart.